    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPENTHOUSE APARTMENT\nWelcome to No. 136 The Oval, TullyVale an exceptionally bright and spacious Penthouse property offering a wonderful sense of space and light throughout due to its corner position on the 4th floor, with large windows and open-plan living areas that make it ideal for modern living. Measuring approx. 101 sq m/ c1087sq ft, with high ceilings throughout. Located just 400 metres from the Cherrywood Luas stop, this beautifully presented home also benefits from a generous balcony of c.180 sq.ft, perfect for enjoying sunsets or entertaining outdoors.\n\nThe apartment comprises of entrance hall, large light filled living/dining room, kitchen, 3 large double bedrooms & guest bathroom. The luxurious principal suite that is larger than average also enjoys direct balcony access, a full ensuite bathroom with his-and-hers sinks & marble tiling and a walk-in wardrobe. There is solid oak wood flooring and tasteful décor throughout making this beautiful home refined and welcoming. \n\nThe location is second to none, with Cabinteely Village, Killiney, and Cabinteely Park all nearby, offering excellent local amenities, cafés, restaurants, and schools. With the M50 and N11 on your doorstep, and the Luas providing direct access to the city centre in under 30 minutes, No. 136 The Oval combines contemporary design, generous proportions, and unrivalled convenience the perfect choice for those seeking stylish living in South Dublin.\nSecure underground and surface parking, along with lift access, ensure convenience and comfort."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Special Features</li><li> Management fee 2815 per annum</li><li> Bright and spacious three double bedroom penthouse apartment totalling c101sqm/ c1087sq ft</li><li> Located in the highly regarded TullyVale development</li><li> Dual-aspect living areas with excellent natural light throughout</li><li> Westerly balcony with open views of the Dublin Mountains</li><li> Fitted kitchen with integrated appliances</li><li> Three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master with full ensuite bathroom & Walk- in wardrobe</li><li> Excellent built-in wardrobes throughout with the master having the large walk-in</li><li> Gas-fired central heating and double-glazed windows</li><li> Lift access to all floors</li><li> Secure underground & overground parking space</li><li> Well-maintained communal gardens and landscaped surroundings</li><li> Killiney and Cabinteely Villages with cafés, restaurants, and local shops</li><li> Close to Cabinteely Park, a popular local amenity</li><li> Excellent transport links including LUAS at Carrickmines, N11, M50, and Dublin Bus routes</li><li> Video Intercom to main door</li><li> 180 Sq Ft westerly aspect balcony</ul>"
      },
      {
